    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?...Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLSPRINT is a first-person momentum-based speedrunner where you navigate tricky obstacles to reach the goal as fast as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Levels - Tricky Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HELLSPRINT, it's all about going for that<strong>\u00a0<i>perfect time </i></strong>(or at least a better time than your friends!). Most levels only take a couple of seconds to beat, which leaves more time to grind for an even better time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find YOUR Way - No Invisible Walls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels have a<i>\u00a0normal</i>\u00a0way of getting to the finish line, but nothing is stopping you from finding your own, faster way.</p>",
